  <name>LayerSeparation</name>
  <type>rundocumentation:LayerSeparation</type>
  <baseType>core:Documentation</baseType>
  <is>What this library owns versus neighbors</is>

  <documentation>Layers:
    • org.blockml.bml.compiler.runtime.* (this library) — facade, registry, scope, RenderContext
    • org.blockml.bml.compiler.parser.* / validator.* — Stage 1–2 algorithms
    • org.blockml.bml.framework.* — TypeRegistry bootstrap used by compileToOutput
    • org.blockml.bml.cli.* — config bootstrap, write files, C5/C6, exit codes
    • target libraries — RenderTarget.render and typed targetOptions

    Do not double-maintain CLI command matrices or target particle rules here.</documentation>
  <references>
    <see type="rundocumentation:ArchitectureOverview" relation="ReadNext"></see>
    <see type="cli:Library" relation="SeeAlso"></see>
    <see type="framework:Library" relation="SeeAlso"></see>
  </references>

</block>
